  "title": "Path traversal in upload file paths from restored backups",
  "summary": "### Impact\r\nUpload records restored from a crafted backup can point outside the uploads directory. Discourse then reads or writes files elsewhere on the server, including configuration files. Only sites with `allow_restore` enabled are affected.\r\n\r\n### Workarounds\r\nKeep `allow_restore` disabled, and only restore backups from trusted sources.\r\n\nDiscovered by Anthropic's OSS Scanner, as vulnerabilities ANT-2026-1JDG572G and ANT-2026-4E9WJ0YN.",
